---
import SectionHead from '@components/SectionHead.astro';
import { LINKS } from '@lib/constants';
---

<section
    class="section"
    aria-labelledby="info-faq-title"
>
    <div class="shell">
        <SectionHead
            eyebrow="Good to know"
            headingId="info-faq-title"
        >
            Frequently asked questions
        </SectionHead>
        <div
            class="info-faq grid max-w-(--measure-prose) gap-3"
            data-scroll
            data-scroll-stagger
        >
            <details name="faq">
                <summary>What are the hours?</summary>
                <div class="prose">
                    <p>Doors at 12PM, music until 10PM on April 17. Come for the live podcast kickoff, stay for the headliners.</p>
                </div>
            </details>
            <details name="faq">
                <summary>Where do I get tickets?</summary>
                <div class="prose">
                    <p>Ticketing details are coming soon. Reach out via the <a href="/contact">contact page</a> or DM <a href={LINKS.instagram} rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">{LINKS.instagramHandle}</a> and we'll let you know the moment they're live.</p>
                </div>
            </details>
            <details name="faq">
                <summary>Is the festival 18+ or all ages?</summary>
                <div class="prose">
                    <p>Age policy will be confirmed with ticketing details.</p>
                </div>
            </details>
            <details name="faq">
                <summary>Is the venue accessible?</summary>
                <div class="prose">
                    <p>We're committed to an accessible festival &mdash; ground-level entry at the garden, and our team can assist with rooftop access. Email <a href={`mailto:${LINKS.email}`}>{LINKS.email}</a> ahead of time and we'll make it work.</p>
                </div>
            </details>
            <details name="faq">
                <summary>What should I bring?</summary>
                <div class="prose">
                    <p>Comfortable shoes, sun protection for the open-air stages, a layer for the evening, and your most authentic self. Outside food and drink aren't permitted &mdash; food trucks and bars are on site.</p>
                </div>
            </details>
            <details name="faq">
                <summary>Can I perform, vend, or volunteer?</summary>
                <div class="prose">
                    <p>Yes! We book performers, vendors, and volunteers every year. Head to the <a href="/contact">contact page</a> and tell us what you do.</p>
                </div>
            </details>
            <details name="faq">
                <summary>What happens if it rains?</summary>
                <div class="prose">
                    <p>EmpowHER is rain or shine &mdash; The Studio is covered, and programming shifts indoors if the weather turns. Updates will be posted to <a href={LINKS.instagram} rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">{LINKS.instagramHandle}</a>.</p>
                </div>
            </details>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .info-faq details {
        background: var(--color-ink-light);
        border: var(--border-soft);
        border-radius: var(--radius-card-sm);
        overflow: clip;
        transition: border-color var(--duration-fast) ease;
    }

    .info-faq details:hover {
        border-color: var(--color-purple-35);
    }

    .info-faq details[open] {
        border-color: var(--color-purple-55);
    }

    .info-faq details[open] summary::after {
        rotate: 45deg;
    }

    .info-faq details > div {
        color: var(--color-lavender);
        padding: 0 1.5rem 1.25rem;
    }

    .info-faq summary {
        align-items: center;
        cursor: pointer;
        display: flex;
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: 1rem;
        font-weight: 500;
        gap: 1rem;
        justify-content: space-between;
        list-style: none;
        padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
        transition:
            color var(--duration-fast) ease,
            opacity var(--duration-fast) ease;
        user-select: none;
    }

    .info-faq summary:active {
        opacity: 0.7;
    }

    .info-faq summary:focus-visible {
        outline-offset: -0.1875rem;
    }

    .info-faq summary:hover {
        color: var(--color-purple-bright);
    }

    .info-faq summary::after {
        color: var(--color-purple);
        content: '+';
        content: '+' / '';
        flex-shrink: 0;
        font-family: var(--font-sans);
        font-size: 1.5rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        transition: rotate var(--duration-base) ease;
    }
</style>
